# Puerto Dinamo (C3, contract 34), 24 x 18. column = i, row = j. Ruta 6 arrives at the north edge, the docks (muelle_dinamo) lie south, Ruta 11 leaves by the east edge.
# The town of an INDUSTRIAL PORT: light concrete in big slabs (2 variants) with a painted safety line down the main road, stacked containers, crates, barrels and bollards, net racks and lobster traps,
# harbour lamps; Centro (door c), tienda (door k), the gym (door g, with a CUTTABLE BUSH closing the pocket in front of its door: the Cortador is needed to enter) and the trader's house (door z) in a row
# along j = 3..4. (The docks with the ferry are a map of their own, memory: the whole port did not fit the budget of one map.)
@map puerto_dinamo
@size 24 18
@interior no
@area puerto_dinamo
@fly 4 puerto_dinamo 3 5 face=S   # the Planeador lands here, in front of the Centro door; slot 4 = visited flag 988 (contract 46.1)
@bg 0
@fill quay
@spawn north 11 1 S             # arriving from Ruta 6
@spawn centro_door 3 5 S
@spawn tienda_door 8 5 S
@spawn gym_door 14 5 S          # inside the pocket in front of the gym door (the bush stands south of it: cut it to leave)
@spawn trueque_door 20 5 S
@spawn south 11 16 N            # back from the docks
@spawn east 22 8 W              # back from Ruta 11
@legend
  .  tile=quay                     # light concrete in big slabs (2 variants)
  P  tile=quay_s                   # the painted safety line
  H  object=crate_plain
  x  object=barrel
  T  object=crate_stack
  b  object=bollard
  t  object=trap
  l  object=lamp_s                 # harbour lamp
  n  tile=quay
  m  tile=quay
  E  tile=quay
  C  object=center_f
  c  door=center_f
  M  object=mart_f
  k  door=mart_f
  G  object=gym_dinamo
  g  door=gym_dinamo
  Z  object=house_f                # the trader's house
  z  door=house_f
  u  cut=yes                       # the cuttable bush in front of the gym
  K  object=container
  N  object=net_rack
  Y  object=net_rack interact=look script=find_net   # D1 (contract 68): the net rack that hides the third Origin Fragment
  S  object=sign interact=look text=puerto.sign
  Q  object=sign interact=look text=puerto.gym.sign
  a  npc=vecino_m id=npc_a face=E script=rumor_dinamo
  V  npc=vecino_m id=npc_b face=SW text=puerto.npc.b
  v  npc=mama id=npc_c face=W text=puerto.npc.c
  I  tile=quay hidden=savia_max   # hidden (contract 80, hidden items)
@grid
  HHxHHHxHHHxnnHxHHHxHHHxH
  H...........P..........H
  H..........SP..........H
  H.CCC..MM...PGGG...ZZ..H
  H.CcC..Mk...PGgG...Zz..H
  H.........lQPx.x.......H
  H...........PHuH.......H
  H.....l.a...P.....l....H
  H...........P....V.....E
  H..HHH......P..........E
  H..T.x......P....KKKT..H
  H..x.....v..P...HKKKH..H
  H....I..x.l.P.l........H
  H.NY.t......P..........H
  H...........P..........H
  H.....b.....P....b.....H
  H...........P..........H
  HHHxHHHxHHHmmHHxHHHxHHHx
@warp n -> ruta_6 spawn=north
@warp m -> muelle_dinamo spawn=north
@warp E -> ruta_11 spawn=west
@warp c -> centro_dinamo spawn=door
@warp k -> tienda_dinamo spawn=door
@warp g -> gimnasio_dinamo spawn=door
@warp z -> casa_trueque spawn=door
# D1 (contract 68): the third Origin Fragment is tangled in a net rack (the sailor's line first, then the rumor + the clue).
@script rumor_dinamo npc
    npc_face_hero npc_a
    say puerto.npc.a
    say d1.dinamo.rumor
    setf legend_rumor
@end
@script find_net interact
    jf frag_3 empty
    say d1.net.look
    give_item origin_shard 1
    jv 0 0 full
    setf frag_3
    sfx item
    say gl.d1.got
    end
  full:
    say gl.found.full
    end
  empty:
    say d1.net.empty
@end
